{"componentChunkName":"component---src-pages-new-projects-js","path":"new-projects/boutique-23-lmd-developers-al-jaddaf-waterfront","result":{"serverData":{"data":{"status":true,"message":"Property details fetch successfully","data":{"id":590,"crm_id":"1158","search_type":"sales","department":"new_developments","status":"pending","title":"Boutique 23","slug":"boutique-23-lmd-developers-al-jaddaf-waterfront","display_address":"Al Jaddaf","building_type":["apartment"],"completion_year":"2026","developer":"LMD Developers","price":970000,"display_price":"970K","lattitude":25.2241574,"longitude":55.3335602,"min_bedrooms":1,"max_bedrooms":3,"display_bedrooms":null,"about":"<p>Boutique 23 is a 23-storey residential complex located in Dubai's Culture Village Al Jaddaf Waterfront. The project was developed by LMD Developers. The complex harmoniously combines cozy apartments, premium office spaces and retail outlets.</p><p>The project offers a wide range of <strong>1-3 bedroom apartments</strong> with panoramic windows offering stunning views of the picturesque neighborhood. The interior design is done in a minimalist style. Bright elements combined with a neutral color palette create a lively and welcoming atmosphere. Geometric shapes and lines in the design add elegance to the interior.</p><p>The building is decorated in a contemporary style with sleek glass and concrete elements.</p><p>The complex offers luxurious living with first class amenities such as gym, rooftop pool and children's pool, children's play area, four level parking, first floor retail outlets.</p><p>The prime location near Sheikh Rashid Road, Al Khail Road and Dubai-Al Ain Road provides quick access to Dubai's major destinations such as Downtown Dubai and Dubai International Airport, 13 minutes away. In addition, the Al Jaddaf neighborhood is home to the Dubai Metro Green Line station. Important infrastructure such as schools such as Swiss International Scientific School and Grammar School, clinics, supermarkets and restaurants are located around the complex, making it a comfortable place to live.</p>","tile_image":null,"banner_image":null,"media_images":null,"images":[{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/off-plan/1158/images/2024/02/26/h0qmy7iH2bIlEmd5eHERqTLx1eN2kl7zR87Vzmar.png","srcUrl":"https://cdn.geniemap.net/2024/02/26/h0qmy7iH2bIlEmd5eHERqTLx1eN2kl7zR87Vzmar.png","__ggfxIndex":0},{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/off-plan/1158/images/2024/02/26/uUDFJOv8Lg2V6v0Szl7LAlXS2d5Kag4BU1Aa8GxB.png","srcUrl":"https://cdn.geniemap.net/2024/02/26/uUDFJOv8Lg2V6v0Szl7LAlXS2d5Kag4BU1Aa8GxB.png","__ggfxIndex":1},{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/off-plan/1158/images/2024/02/26/USy8RnnGa92jQTHETjEhMSQdDQ77fnzsvzeY8X68.png","srcUrl":"https://cdn.geniemap.net/2024/02/26/USy8RnnGa92jQTHETjEhMSQdDQ77fnzsvzeY8X68.png","__ggfxIndex":2},{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/off-plan/1158/images/2024/02/26/lQvb074PGsZ8kYxohI4OwY3MvPCZN4Q5QjcLboky.png","srcUrl":"https://cdn.geniemap.net/2024/02/26/lQvb074PGsZ8kYxohI4OwY3MvPCZN4Q5QjcLboky.png","__ggfxIndex":3},{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/off-plan/1158/images/2024/02/26/AWFDxwFLi3N4PYJ3vLxjdKcnktvGyvVoAZt8zz5F.png","srcUrl":"https://cdn.geniemap.net/2024/02/26/AWFDxwFLi3N4PYJ3vLxjdKcnktvGyvVoAZt8zz5F.png","__ggfxIndex":4},{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/off-plan/1158/images/2024/02/26/Sa8HfzWhcvrlI5jx80OzbRnjyRpUaJKb6IfPWp3a.png","srcUrl":"https://cdn.geniemap.net/2024/02/26/Sa8HfzWhcvrlI5jx80OzbRnjyRpUaJKb6IfPWp3a.png","__ggfxIndex":5}],"characteristics_module":null,"location_tile":null,"brochure":{"id":1821,"url":"","file":null,"item":[],"image":null},"video_module":{"id":1078,"thumbnail":null,"video_url":null},"floor_plans":[{"id":1821,"url":null,"area":null,"size":null,"media":null,"title":"1 Bedroom Apartment","kitchen":null,"parking":null